 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The sons of Joseph spoke to Joshua,",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying why one lot for us today,",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We are a numerous and blessed people,",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet we receive but one inheritance.",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joshua answered with a firm command,",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go up into the forest land,",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Clear ground in the land of Perizzites,",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the Rephaim dwell in old days.",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They said the hill country is too cramped,",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Canaanites in valleys strong,",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They have iron chariots of war,",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Beth-shean and Jezreel ground.",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Joshua spoke to Ephraim and Manasseh,",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have great strength and power immense,",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hill country shall be yours to take,",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though it is forest, clear it well.",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It shall be yours to its farthest limits,",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Drive out the Canaanites who stay,",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even with iron chariots strong,",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will make the land your own.",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The forest cleared and the land is mine.",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
